# PLACEHOLDER. This file holds no key yet.
#
# The real Ed25519 public key is added here when cloud-api's entitlement signing key is created (plan
# step 0.5). Only the public half is ever committed; the private key stays a cloud-api secret.
#
# Format once filled: these comment lines, then the key as PEM SPKI:
#   -----BEGIN PUBLIC KEY-----
#   <base64 of the 44-byte SPKI DER for an Ed25519 key>
#   -----END PUBLIC KEY-----
# Key id (JWS header "kid"): entitlement-v1. A new key gets a new file (entitlement-v2.pub) and kid, and the
# Worker accepts both during the change-over. See spec/accounts-v1.md, "Entitlement claim".
#
# Until the PEM block is present the Worker must fail closed: no claim verifies, so every route that needs
# a plan or perk answers 503 accounts_not_configured. Public reads and downloads are unaffected.
